{
 "sweep_id": "example_cluster_umap_hdbscan",
 "description": "HDBSCAN on 40 columns, after a reduce step: UMAP to 10 dimensions with 30 neighbours and min_dist 0 (the settings UMAP's documentation gives for clustering), against PCA to 10 and no reduction, chosen by DBCV. UMAP needs the unsupervised profile; the PCA and no-reduction variants run with core alone.",
 "purpose": "learning",
 "follows": [],
